Riseonly patch on zed 6b2aa1c (Apache-2.0 crates gpui, gpui_wgpu, gpui_windows), applied by scripts/vendor-gpui.py after 0003.
OwnedSurfaceFrame gains a pixel format: OwnedSurfaceFrame::bgra carries one BGRA plane with premultiplied alpha
(WebM stickers with their alpha stream joined in). The DirectX 11 renderer keeps a B8G8R8A8 texture per BGRA stream,
uploaded with UpdateSubresource on a new generation, and draws it with a bgra_surface shader and the premultiplied
blend (ONE, INV_SRC_ALPHA). The wgpu renderer skips BGRA frames until P147 draws them (P146 win).

